Package: d-spy
Version: @DEB_D-SPY_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.gnome.org/Dspy/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, dbus
Description: D-Spy (GTK4 D-Bus explorer)
 D-Spy lets you inspect D-Bus: browse the names on the session and system bus,
 walk their objects, interfaces, methods, signals and properties, and call
 methods interactively. GTK4/libadwaita, pure C. Needs a running D-Bus session.
